The schema.org vocabulary, release 30.1 as of 2026-09-25, from
https://schema.org/version/latest/schemaorg-all-https.jsonld (current, pending
and attic terms). Refresh by hand: re-download that URL over this file. The
@adobe/structured-data-validator reads it to check that a type exists in
schema.org and a property is supported by the type it sits on.
